<!--
  Hand-written fixture standing in for a PowerStig processed STIG file. It mirrors the real
  shape - a DISASTIG element holding one collection per rule type, each rule carrying the
  elements the matching Build-Ansible<Type>Task adapter reads - but holds only the handful of
  rules the tests need, so the expected output can be written out in full.

  Every rule here has OrganizationValueRequired of False; the WindowsClient-11 fixture carries
  the ones that do not, so each file exercises one half of that branch. Nothing stops them
  sharing a file - the org settings path they used to depend on was fixed by docs/adr/0002.

  Severities are spread across high, medium and low so all three cat files get written.
-->
